{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10560","headline":"张公洞 · 李栖筠","name":"张公洞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一径深窈窕，上升翠微中。\n忽然灵洞前，日月开仙宫。\n道士十二人，往还驭清风。\n焚香入深洞，巨石如虚空。\n夙夜备苹藻，诏书祠张公。\n五云何裴回，玄鹤下苍穹。\n我本道门子，愿言出尘笼。\n扫除方寸间，几与神灵通。\n宿昔勤梦想，契之在深衷。\n迟回将不还，章绶击我躬。\n稽首谢真侣，辞满归崆峒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李栖筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}